{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20805","headline":"蜻蜓歌 · 卢仝","name":"蜻蜓歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄河中流日影斜，水天一色无津涯。\n处处惊波喷流飞雪花，篙工檝师力且武。\n进寸退尺莫能度，吾甚惧。\n念汝小虫子，造化借羽翼。\n随风戏中流，翩然有余力。\n吾不如汝无他，无羽翼。\n吾若有羽翼，则上叩天关。\n爲圣君请贤臣，布惠化于人间。\n然後东飞浴东溟，吸日精。\n撼若木之英，纷而零。\n使地上学仙之子，得而食之皆长生。\n不学汝无端小虫子，叶叶水上无一事，忽遭风雨水中死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}